===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|es|osp|ynvierno}}, variant of {{m|osp|yvierno}}, from {{inh|es|VL.|*invernum}}, a modification of {{der|es|la|hībernum}} ({{m|la|tempus}}) (compare {{cog|ca|hivern}}, {{cog|fr|hiver}}, {{cog|it|inverno}}, {{cog|pt|inverno}}, {{cog|ro|iarnă}}), from {{m|la|hībernus||wintry}}, from {{inh|es|ine-pro||*ǵʰey-m-r-ino-}}, from {{der|es|ine-pro|*ǵʰey-}}.

